        {
          "id": 2590282828,
          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "As John writes, Lua doesn't know, and should not know, about how Qt handles mnemonic internally.\n\nI will suggest adding a specific format to set a mnemonic, and then translate this into Qt `&&`.",
